\newlabel{fig:withinpr}{{2}{5}{Human co-approval rate among the 282{} PRs where an AI bot issued an APPROVED review. Red: AI-authored (n=31{}). Blue: human-authored (n=251{}). Point estimates differ by +5.3{} percentage points (directionally consistent with AI reviewers approving AI code humans disagree with more often), but the two-proportion test is not significant ($p=0.53${}) and the 95\% CIs overlap --- no statistically significant replication of the \citet {laurito2025aibias} single-turn AI-AI bias in this narrow slice. Error bars: Wilson 95\% CIs. Not adjusted for code quality}{figure.caption.3}{}}
